OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AYoung people aren't snowflakes - mental
OL,4,Adistress is rising, says head of
OL,5,Aofficial review
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said it was "harder to be young" now
OL,8,Fgiven the economic and employment
OL,9,Funcertainty young people face, coupled
OL,10,Fwith the challenges presented by social
OL,11,Fmedia.
OL,13,FHis review was ordered nine months ago
OL,14,Fby Wes Streeting after the then-health
OL,15,Fsecretary claimed in an interview that
OL,16,Fyoung people were over-diagnosed and
OL,17,F"written off".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
