OL,3,AOxford grooming gang survivors tell BBC
OL,4,A'hundreds' of abusers still free
OL,5,
OL,6,FSarah and two other survivors believe
OL,7,F"hundreds" of perpetrators are still
OL,8,Ffree. An ex-police detective who led
OL,9,Fthe initial investigation into grooming
OL,10,Fgangs in Oxford agrees.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
