OL,3,ASeven Ethiopian rebel groups form new
OL,4,Aalliance
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral of the rebel groups which have
OL,7,Fbeen fighting the Ethiopian authorities
OL,8,Fin different parts of the country have
OL,9,Fannounced they have formed an alliance
OL,10,Fto remove the government in Addis
OL,11,FAbaba.
OL,13,FThe alliance brings together the Fano
OL,14,Fmilitia in Amhara, the Oromo Liberation
OL,15,FArmy (OLA), Tigray People's Liberation
OL,16,FFront (TPLF) and four other smaller
OL,17,Fgroupings in a coalition named Alliance
OL,18,Ffor Survival.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
