OL,3,ASeven Ethiopian rebel groups form new
OL,4,Aalliance
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe seven groups accuse Prime Minister
OL,7,FAbiy Ahmed's government of presiding
OL,8,Fover "war, genocide, mass destruction,
OL,9,Fand utter poverty", claiming Ethiopia
OL,10,Fis at risk of disintegration.
OL,12,FFederal authorities have not yet
OL,13,Fresponded.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
