OL,3,AMore than 1.6 million urged to evacuate
OL,4,Aas powerful typhoon threatens Japan
OL,5,
OL,6,FDujuan has sustained winds of 130km/h
OL,7,F(80.8mph) and gusts of up to 194km/h.
OL,8,FIt could bring up to 350mm of rain to
OL,9,Fthe Tokai region
OL,11,FThe storm is the latest in a wave of
OL,12,Fstorms in the Pacific, made more
OL,13,Fintense by this year's "super El Nino",
OL,14,Fwhich has warmed the ocean and fuelled
OL,15,Fthe formation of storms
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
